    "how_candidates_were_found": "joined roster_YYYY -> players.csv BY GSIS (never by name: 4% of roster rows carry a different name than players.csv, e.g. roster_2020 says \"Nick Westbrook\" where players.csv says \"Nick Westbrook-Ikhine\"), then scored BDL name against EVERY known spelling plus team overlap and career bounds.",
